        <zone h='35637' id='9' name='D1 Sources' w='96000' x='2000' y='12743'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d6d8d2' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='12959' id='10' type-v2='text' w='47500' x='2000' y='50324'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#5e6561' fontname='Consolas' fontsize='8'>DEFINITIONS</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#454c48' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>K1 value of beneficiated sales (AMB, nominal R$) · K13 HHI = Σ share² × 10,000 (≥ 2,500 highly concentrated, 1,500–2,500 moderate) · K15 CFEM = royalty collected, not revenue.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d6d8d2' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fbfaf6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='12959' id='11' type-v2='text' w='47500' x='50500' y='50324'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#5e6561' fontname='Consolas' fontsize='8'>PERIOD</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#454c48' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>AMB 2010–2025 (base years). CFEM 2004 – Jun 2026 (usable months; 2026 partial).</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d6d8d2' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fbfaf6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='12959' id='12' type-v2='text' w='47500' x='2000' y='64579'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#5e6561' fontname='Consolas' fontsize='8'>RULES</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#454c48' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>T8 substance collapse into groups · T13 duplicate CFEM export of Feb 2024 removed · completeness checks per year.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d6d8d2' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fbfaf6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='12959' id='13' type-v2='text' w='47500' x='50500' y='64579'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#5e6561' fontname='Consolas' fontsize='8'>RESTRICTIONS</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#454c48' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Nominal values (no deflation) · legal entity (CNPJ root) ≠ economic group · ES iron-ore caveat (pellet plants report sales of ore mined in MG) · no municipal map.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d6d8d2' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fbfaf6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='12959' id='14' type-v2='text' w='47500' x='2000' y='78834'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#5e6561' fontname='Consolas' fontsize='8'>HOW TO USE</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#454c48' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>The YEAR, SUBSTANCE and STATE boxes filter every page. Clicking a bar, a state, a heatmap cell or a table row sets them and the choice follows you across pages; pick All in the box to reset. Views that need one substance (price × volume, HHI, company Pareto) show iron ore when All is selected.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d6d8d2' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fbfaf6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='12959' id='15' type-v2='text' w='47500' x='50500' y='78834'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#5e6561' fontname='Consolas' fontsize='8'>UPDATE</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#454c48' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>From mining-intelligence/: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File src\run_pipeline.ps1 -Download, then refresh the extracts.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d6d8d2' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='margin' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fbfaf6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='3024' id='16' type-v2='text' w='96000' x='2000' y='96328'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='false' fontcolor='#5e6561' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>Source: ANM AMB &amp; CFEM, snapshot 2026-11-18 · nominal R$ · CFEM is royalty, not revenue · click any bar, state or row to filter (All resets) · Stephany Alves</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{52183CA7-6EB1-5246-BCE9-598EF51BAF53}' />
    </dashboard>
